    <string name="disclaimer_intro">By using the EnfermerApp application, you accept and acknowledge the following terms:</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec1_title">1. Support Tool, Not a Substitute:</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec1_body">EnfermerApp is an auxiliary tool to facilitate common calculations in nursing practice. Under no circumstances does this application replace professional clinical judgment or medical supervision.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec2_title">2. Obligation to Validate:</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec2_body">The user (nursing staff, physician, or any healthcare professional) has the undelegable OBLIGATION to manually verify and validate all results generated by the application before administration or application to the patient. Calculation inaccuracy may put the patient\'s health at risk.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec3_title">3. Limitation of Liability:</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec3_body">The Creator of the application (the Developer) is not responsible for direct, indirect, incidental, or punitive consequences resulting from incorrect, inadequate, or negligent use of the data provided by EnfermerApp. The use of this application is under the sole responsibility of the professional using it and/or the healthcare center where treatments are applied.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec4_title">4. Integrity and Formulas:</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_sec4_body">The Developer strives to use universally accepted formulas, but the user must ensure that these formulas are appropriate for their institution\'s clinical guidelines.</string>

